Subject: [PATCH v2 5/5] media: staging: rkisp1: cap: remove unsupported formats
Date:   Thu,  2 Apr 2020 21:04:19 +0200
Message-Id: <20200402190419.15155-6-dafna.hirschfeld@collabora.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.1
